  "body": "Step inside and discover a home where space, light and garden beauty come together effortlessly.\r\n\r\nDesigned with two distinct living zones, this beautifully presented three-bedroom, two-bathroom home offers flexibility for families, guests, teenagers or those working from home.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, an inviting open-plan living, dining and kitchen area creates the heart of the home. Large windows frame the beautifully established garden, bringing the changing colours of the seasons and the gentle sounds of birds right into your everyday living.\r\n\r\nA separate door leads through to a second, wonderfully private living area. At its centre is a spacious family bathroom, flanked by two bedrooms - both enjoying a lovely outlook over the lush garden. Wake up to greenery and birdsong rather than the usual suburban view.\r\n\r\nUpstairs is your own private retreat. The generous master bedroom comes complete with its own bathroom, while a separate office provides the perfect space for working from home or a quiet study. Open the floor-to-ceiling doors from the master bedroom and step onto the large balcony, where you can sit back, enjoy the sunshine and take in the wider outlook.\r\n\r\nThe double internal-access garage is another practical highlight, with easy drive-in access and plenty of room for everyday family living.\r\n\r\nAnd then there is the location. Positioned in sought-after Milford, you are close to Milford Shopping Centre, cafés, restaurants, supermarkets, Takapuna and North Shore Hospital, with excellent schooling options including Westlake Boys' and Westlake Girls' High Schools nearby.\r\n\r\nA home that offers more than bedrooms and bathrooms - a beautiful garden sanctuary, flexible living and a location that makes everyday life exceptionally convenient.\r\n\r\nCome and experience 79A Nile Road for yourself. This is one you'll want",
